X-TenantId: 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6

###

POST {{CineControl.CinemaService.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Cinemas/{{cinemaId}}/theaters
Content-Type: application/json
X-TenantId: 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6

{
  "name": "test",
  "SeatingCapacity": 80,
  "SeatsPerRow": 10
}

###
@theaterId = {{GetTheaters.response.body.$.[0].id}}
