Content-Type: application/json
X-TenantId: 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6

###

PUT {{CineControl.CinemaService.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Cinemas/{{cinemaId}}/theaters/{{theaterId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-TenantId: 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6

{
  "name": "test",
  "SeatingCapacity": 40,
  "SeatsPerRow": 10
}

###

DELETE {{CineControl.CinemaService.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Cinemas/{{cinemaId}}/theaters/{{theaterId}}
